@base = http://localhost:5102
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Get Alice's account
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

### Withdraw 100 € (returns the updated account)
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Transfer from Alice to Bob
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 250 }

### Transfer refused by the domain service: 5,000 € limit (400)
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 6000 }
